-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Network의 Bandwidth 한계</h3>\n<p><span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 650px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/89c8825b4e3433280a87344c0012ff09/663f3/2022-01-25-21-20-39.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 47.64705882352941%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='2022 01 25 21 20 39' title='' src='/static/89c8825b4e3433280a87344c0012ff09/663f3/2022-01-25-21-20-39.png' srcset='/static/89c8825b4e3433280a87344c0012ff09/e7570/2022-01-25-21-20-39.png 170w,\n/static/89c8825b4e3433280a87344c0012ff09/f46e7/2022-01-25-21-20-39.png 340w,\n/static/89c8825b4e3433280a87344c0012ff09/663f3/2022-01-25-21-20-39.png 650w' sizes='(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>10G 스위치에 10Gbps 이상의 데이터가 전달된다면, Capacity를 넘어가는 순간부터 패킷 드랍이 발생한다.</li>\n<li>Switch도 이중화가 필요하다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"서버에-연결된-인터넷-망이-장애가-난다면\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%84%9C%EB%B2%84%EC%97%90-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%EB%90%9C-%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%EB%84%B7-%EB%A7%9D%EC%9D%B4-%EC%9E%A5%EC%95%A0%EA%B0%80-%EB%82%9C%EB%8B%A4%EB%A9%B4\" aria-label=\"서버에 연결된 인터넷 망이 장애가 난다면 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.